       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults, which is 3,200 mg/day by prescription in divided doses.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also well above the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events goes up a lot. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove that risk.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum dose for conditions like inflammatory arthritis\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours** for pain or fever (1,600\u20132,400 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg per day total**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nIf you do want the original 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical reason and I'll enter it with a note. Otherwise, tell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away."
